id=coresight_etm4x
name=CoreSight ETE0-7 (coresight-etm4x) for shennong / SM8650
version=v1.2
versionCode=3
author=lin293387-del
description=Loads coresight-etm4x.ko at boot so the APSS ETE0-7 trace sources get their driver and perf/simpleperf cs_etm instruction tracing works. Touches /data only, never a partition. Pinned to one verified kernel, so a system update makes it refuse to load instead of risking the boot loader. Disabling OR removing it restores stock behaviour (after a reboot, or immediately via the Action button).
